data: {"id": "046f1cff0df74178-thinking-parallel_evidence-1638", "run_id": "046f1cff0df74178", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 状态 (Describe/YAML)**\n    - Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload` 当前处于 `Running` 阶段，但容器状态为 `Waiting`，原因为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n    - 容器 `app` 退出码 (Exit Code) 为 **78**，终止原因为 `Error`。\n    - 重启次数：**21次**。\n    - 探针/资源：未配置探针，资源限制较低 (CPU 50m, 内存 32Mi)。\n    - 环境变量：**Environment: <none>**，未定义任何环境变量。\n\n2. **崩溃前日志 (Previous Logs)**\n    - 日志明确输出：`APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing`。\n    - 镜像内的启动命令逻辑为：检查 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 环境变量，缺失则打印报错并以 exit code 78 退出。\n\n3. **指标 (Promethe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789145218026, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

