data: {"id": "046f1cff0df74178-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "046f1cff0df74178", "seq": 1639, "ts_ms": 1789145225747, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 36.379, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v10", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/046f1cff0df74178-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "f95404a443e229047e9312f64f15691c3d219b0ad9e0e75222a5501e981b071f", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "df9c30d26d3b54b838ecafefda364bd815a0d772fbd45dcd6df40b5ba27a87a0"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "046f1cff0df74178-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "046f1cff0df74178", "seq": 1640, "ts_ms": 1789145225748, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "046f1cff0df74178-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "046f1cff0df74178", "seq": 1641, "ts_ms": 1789145231994, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 6.246, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1180, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 缺少环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error | 证明容器最后一次以非零状态退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: 78 | 提供具体的进程退出码，指向应用层启动失败 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `log.message`: \"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\" | 直接捕获应用启动时的关键报错，明确缺失依赖 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message`: \"Warning BackOff ... kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app\" | 证明 Kubernetes 正在频繁重启容器并进入退避机制 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1 (CrashLoopBackOff) | 监控侧确认当前容器处于等待重启状态 |\n\n日志中明确记录了环境变量的缺失，这与 K8s 记录的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态及 `Exit Code 78` 高度一致：应用启动脚本因找不到 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 而主动终止。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义中未配置环境变量 → 启动脚本检查缺失 → 进程以 78 退出 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 配置中缺少必需的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`。**\n\n日志（#3）明确指出了具体的缺失对象，结合 K8s 状态（#1, #2）中观察到的非零退出码，形成了完整的证据闭环。该配置缺失导致应用无法正常启动，进而触发 K8s 的重启策略，表现为当前的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 缺少环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error | 证明容器最后一次以非零状态退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: 78 | 提供具体的进程退出码，指向应用层启动失败 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `log.message`: \"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\" | 直接捕获应用启动时的关键报错，明确缺失依赖 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message`: \"Warning BackOff ... kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app\" | 证明 Kubernetes 正在频繁重启容器并进入退避机制 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1 (CrashLoopBackOff) | 监控侧确认当前容器处于等待重启状态 |\n\n日志中明确记录了环境变量的缺失，这与 K8s 记录的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态及 `Exit Code 78` 高度一致：应用启动脚本因找不到 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 而主动终止。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义中未配置环境变量 → 启动脚本检查缺失 → 进程以 78 退出 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 配置中缺少必需的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`。**\n\n日志（#3）明确指出了具体的缺失对象，结合 K8s 状态（#1, #2）中观察到的非零退出码，形成了完整的证据闭环。该配置缺失导致应用无法正常启动，进而触发 K8s 的重启策略，表现为当前的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

